# The first milestone: one MFD, "MFD C" in docs/HARDWARE_MAPPING.md, eight
# lit keys under a 320x240 screen. A layout puts profile names on modules;
# the module is found by its unique id, never by port.
#
#   module NAME CLASS UID
#   NAME key INDEX LOGICAL [LABEL]     keys 1-4 above the screen, 5-8 below
#   NAME text FIELD X Y SIZE LOGICAL
#   NAME bar FIELD X Y W H MAX LOGICAL

module mfd:C mfd vmfd-C

mfd:C key 1 func.radar RADAR
mfd:C key 2 func.map MAP
mfd:C key 3 func.damage DAMAGE
mfd:C key 4 func.target TARGET
mfd:C key 5 func.radar2km 2 KM
mfd:C key 6 func.zoomin ZOOM+
mfd:C key 7 func.zoomout ZOOM-
mfd:C key 8 func.indirect INDIRECT

mfd:C text 1 8 70 2 message
mfd:C text 2 8 130 2 engine
mfd:C text 3 250 130 3 readout
mfd:C text 4 8 170 1 weapon.0.name
mfd:C bar 5 120 170 120 10 8 weapon.0.bar
